{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"b57537b505495fea8cad855e49fd21e9bd558d482525d2ab5b4665b262a65b5c","slug":"introduction.prior-art","location":"/introduction/prior_art.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"已有工作","content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Lukas Heumos","given":"Lukas","family":"Heumos"},"name":"Lukas Heumos","id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-0"},{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Anna Schaar","given":"Anna","family":"Schaar"},"name":"Anna Schaar","id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-1"},{"nameParsed":{"literal":"single-cell best practices consortium","given":"single-cell","non_dropping_particle":"best practices","family":"consortium"},"name":"single-cell best practices consortium","id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-2"}],"github":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-best-practices","settings":{"output_matplotlib_strings":"remove"},"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"source_url":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-best-practices/blob/main/.build/v2-candidate/maintenance-2026-09-13-01/overlay/introduction/prior_art.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-best-practices/edit/main/.build/v2-candidate/maintenance-2026-09-13-01/overlay/introduction/prior_art.md","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"prior_art.md","url":"/single-cell-best-practices-zh/build/prior_art-f94c88dee9e62a44b7230188415718bd.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"comment","value":" END DROPDOWNS ","key":"a70zCMInlY"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"单细胞分析已从一个小众的研究方向，发展为一个成熟的研究领域。因此，我们当然不是第一个就这一主题著书的人，也不是第一个提供指南与教程的人。在接下来的几节中，我们将回顾两个旨在教授单细胞分析、广受关注且仍在持续推进的项目，并说明它们与本书的相似之处和不同之处。","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"key":"golxmJ0SgD"}],"key":"ZU1O4Lccmd"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Bioconductor OSCA 与 OSTA 系列图书","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"JI59ytauKH"}],"label":"introduction-prior-art-key-takeaway-1","identifier":"introduction-prior-art-key-takeaway-1","html_id":"introduction-prior-art-key-takeaway-1","key":"yAz3aSloWD"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"《利用 Bioconductor 构建单细胞分析流程》（Bioconductor OSCA）","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"cLY9NLBpqe"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"pa:osca","identifier":"pa:osca","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Amezquita ","key":"SjUIerrnyb"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"UM7FFpJDUB"}],"key":"AMLGp2y5M9"},{"type":"text","value":", 2022","key":"HCblU4Pxqt"}],"enumerator":"1","key":"yXUgWVjhy8"}],"key":"qB4fQNSzF2"},{"type":"text","value":"，可在线访问，网址为 ","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"MCQSBTP5V9"},{"type":"link","url":"https://bioconductor.org/books/release/OSCA/","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"https://​bioconductor​.org​/books​/release​/OSCA/","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"cXY8sVV6ih"}],"urlSource":"https://bioconductor.org/books/release/OSCA/","key":"zIpyPpIbtg"},{"type":"text","value":"。这本在线书籍介绍如何使用 R 语言的 Bioconductor 生态系统，按常用工作流分析单细胞 ","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"MEso1MDSCY"},{"type":"crossReference","label":"RNA","identifier":"term-rna","children":[{"type":"text","value":"RNA ","key":"ajWAqxb5Sx"}],"kind":"definitionTerm","template":"{name}","resolved":true,"html_id":"term-rna","remote":true,"url":"/glossary","dataUrl":"/glossary.json","key":"uP22LX5uFj"},{"type":"text","value":"","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"oYKSZT9qkj"},{"type":"crossReference","label":"Sequencing","identifier":"term-sequencing","children":[{"type":"text","value":"测序","key":"rhEihz69Rr"}],"kind":"definitionTerm","template":"{name}","resolved":true,"html_id":"term-sequencing","remote":true,"url":"/glossary","dataUrl":"/glossary.json","key":"uudHnNW7EK"},{"type":"text","value":"（single-cell RNA sequencing, scRNA-seq）数据 ","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"xrDlv58kuw"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"pa:Huber2015","identifier":"pa:huber2015","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Huber ","key":"PS9tWfb752"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"gsO1Yh8cId"}],"key":"dOBu6BMINP"},{"type":"text","value":", 2015","key":"PWDGBI1QOK"}],"enumerator":"2","key":"fthKYpYQjL"}],"key":"fuHRSBA6PJ"},{"type":"text","value":"。一篇标题相同的配套论文 ","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"cWdym4conz"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"pa:Amezquita2020","identifier":"pa:amezquita2020","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Amezquita ","key":"bojscfhpks"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"TBDpXeddOW"}],"key":"i8MvBrf481"},{"type":"text","value":", 2020","key":"ScbxhYjjrH"}],"enumerator":"3","key":"iMiYMO2V30"}],"key":"lnbrTKsn3a"},{"type":"text","value":" 概述了如何借助 Bioconductor 进行单细胞分析，而在线书籍则提供了更深入的内容，配有详细的讲解和大量代码示例。","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"XCbZwj5fZr"}],"key":"ph10lWnb8W"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"OSCA 一书对基础的 scRNA-seq 分析论述得非常全面，讲解清晰，并配有详细的工作流程示例。不过，它并未延伸到其他单细胞组学，例如单细胞转座酶可及染色质测序（single-cell assay for transposase-accessible chromatin using sequencing, scATAC-seq）。空间转录组学（spatial transcriptomics）则在配套书籍《利用 Bioconductor 构建空间分辨转录组学分析流程》（Bioconductor OSTA）中单独讨论，该书可在以下网址获取：","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"WxRYyuats2"},{"type":"link","url":"https://lmweber.org/OSTA-book/","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"https://​lmweber​.org​/OSTA​-book/","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"p48yaYdgez"}],"urlSource":"https://lmweber.org/OSTA-book/","key":"CAWc95ifvx"},{"type":"text","value":"。","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"AigE3FGO3G"}],"key":"x99WLI6L0h"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"由于这两本书都是为 Bioconductor 生态系统量身打造的，它们只使用 Bioconductor 中已有的工具。这些工具虽然非常有效，但正如两本书自己所承认的那样，它们未必总能为每一项分析提供最优方案。总体而言，这两本 Bioconductor 图书尤其适合具备 R 基础知识、又有扎实生物学背景，并希望在 Bioconductor 框架内学习分析单细胞与空间转录组学数据的读者。","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"VWa8wSLqTx"}],"key":"eRfWFPy5od"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"单细胞 RNA-seq 分析的当前最佳实践：一篇教程","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"key":"xQN27JbGvh"}],"label":"introduction-prior-art-key-takeaway-2","identifier":"introduction-prior-art-key-takeaway-2","html_id":"introduction-prior-art-key-takeaway-2","key":"eddGclzCbN"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":31,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Current Best Practices in Single-Cell ","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"ACe164ZpDA"},{"type":"crossReference","label":"RNA","identifier":"term-rna","children":[{"type":"text","value":"RNA","key":"Qdcv5Xl2hJ"}],"kind":"definitionTerm","template":"{name}","resolved":true,"html_id":"term-rna","remote":true,"url":"/glossary","dataUrl":"/glossary.json","key":"Ci5r1MTzXY"},{"type":"text","value":"-Seq Analysis: A Tutorial ","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"h1KabM8BsE"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"pa:Lücken2019","identifier":"pa:lücken2019","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Luecken & Theis, 2019","key":"gA1uwzf3pE"}],"enumerator":"4","key":"BEfzaCUqHi"}],"key":"Pan3xVo4NA"},{"type":"text","value":" 一文由 Malte Lücken 和 Fabian Theis 撰写，介绍了 scRNA-seq 分析的最佳实践。其核心贡献不仅在于梳理各种潜在的分析步骤，更在于基于独立的基准测试推荐最佳实践。在缺乏具体最佳实践指南时，作者也针对分析方法给出了通用建议。这种聚焦独立基准测试的根本理念，极大地启发了我们的工作。与这篇论文相辅相成的，还有一份 ","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"DbqE2ib8zl"},{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-tutorial/","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"小鼠肠道上皮区域实例分析","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"yAmx3vaoaB"}],"urlSource":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-tutorial/","error":true,"key":"AK0YczVVbp"},{"type":"text","value":"（来自 Haber 等人）","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"yC1reNtzF4"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"pa:Haber2017","identifier":"pa:haber2017","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Haber ","key":"FzkFJ9dbHQ"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"Qk5DFFLfLL"}],"key":"Gb4d3qVjr0"},{"type":"text","value":", 2017","key":"aq6YYnXFah"}],"enumerator":"5","key":"bG8QrM5B3P"}],"key":"xQE2ehXixM"},{"type":"text","value":"。","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"zC7iFfg2lJ"}],"key":"JMjI3HOlBQ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"与 Bioconductor OSCA 相比，这篇论文及其配套分析不受特定工具生态系统的约束，因而在所涵盖的主题范围上提供了更广阔的视角。不过，随附的示例分析对初学者不够友好，而且已经过时。与 Bioconductor OSCA 类似，Lücken 和 Theis 也未涉及 RNA 速率（RNA velocity）、空间转录组学或多组学（multi-omics）等较新的进展。","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"key":"gElssEXvJ3"}],"key":"jeExvGHUNq"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":37,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"尽管存在这些局限，我们仍强烈推荐这篇论文，可将其作为了解该领域的宝贵入门读物，以及 scRNA-seq 分析初步最佳实践的指南。本书各章建立在最新的最佳实践之上，为该领域提供了与时俱进的视角。此外，本书对各工作流程的讲解更为详尽，为读者有效运用这些方法提供了必要的背景知识。我们建议读者不要依赖该论文随附的示例案例研究，而应阅读本书中详尽的章节，以获得更全面、更新的理解。","position":{"start":{"line":37,"column":1},"end":{"line":37,"column":1}},"key":"iSI1Ks9nrI"}],"key":"yTUbvbpBQM"}],"key":"gnOmC2R10Q"}],"key":"KP3q2my2aP"},"references":{"cite":{"order":["pa:osca","pa:Huber2015","pa:Amezquita2020","pa:Lücken2019","pa:Haber2017"],"data":{"pa:osca":{"label":"pa:osca","enumerator":"1","html":"Amezquita, R., Lun, A., Hicks, S., & Raphael, G. (2022). <i>Orchestrating Single-Cell Analysis with Bioconductor</i>. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://bioconductor.org/books/release/OSCA/\">https://bioconductor.org/books/release/OSCA/</a>","url":"https://bioconductor.org/books/release/OSCA/"},"pa:Huber2015":{"label":"pa:Huber2015","enumerator":"2","doi":"10.1038/nmeth.3252","html":"Huber, W., Carey, V. J., Gentleman, R., Anders, S., Carlson, M., Carvalho, B. S., Bravo, H. C., Davis, S., Gatto, L., Girke, T., Gottardo, R., Hahne, F., Hansen, K. D., Irizarry, R. A., Lawrence, M., Love, M. I., MacDonald, J., Obenchain, V., Oleś, A. K., … Morgan, M. (2015). Orchestrating high-throughput genomic analysis with Bioconductor. <i>Nature Methods</i>, <i>12</i>(2), 115–121. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/nmeth.3252\">10.1038/nmeth.3252</a>","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/nmeth.3252"},"pa:Amezquita2020":{"label":"pa:Amezquita2020","enumerator":"3","doi":"10.1038/s41592-019-0654-x","html":"Amezquita, R. A., Lun, A. T. L., Becht, E., Carey, V. J., Carpp, L. N., Geistlinger, L., Marini, F., Rue-Albrecht, K., Risso, D., Soneson, C., Waldron, L., Pagès, H., Smith, M. L., Huber, W., Morgan, M., Gottardo, R., & Hicks, S. C. (2020). Orchestrating single-cell analysis with Bioconductor. <i>Nature Methods</i>, <i>17</i>(2), 137–145. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41592-019-0654-x\">10.1038/s41592-019-0654-x</a>","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41592-019-0654-x"},"pa:Lücken2019":{"label":"pa:Lücken2019","enumerator":"4","doi":"https://doi.org/10.15252/msb.20188746","html":"Luecken, M. D., & Theis, F. J. (2019). Current best practices in single-cell term`RNA`-seq analysis: a tutorial. <i>Molecular Systems Biology</i>, <i>15</i>(6), e8746. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.15252/msb.20188746\">https://doi.org/10.15252/msb.20188746</a>","url":"https://doi.org/10.15252/msb.20188746"},"pa:Haber2017":{"label":"pa:Haber2017","enumerator":"5","doi":"10.1038/nature24489","html":"Haber, A. L., Biton, M., Rogel, N., Herbst, R. H., Shekhar, K., Smillie, C., Burgin, G., Delorey, T. M., Howitt, M. R., Katz, Y., Tirosh, I., Beyaz, S., Dionne, D., Zhang, M., Raychowdhury, R., Garrett, W. S., Rozenblatt-Rosen, O., Shi, H. N., Yilmaz, O., … Regev, A. (2017). A single-cell survey of the small intestinal epithelium. <i>Nature</i>, <i>551</i>(7680), 333–339. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/nature24489\">10.1038/nature24489</a>","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/nature24489"}}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"单细胞最佳实践","url":"/","group":"单细胞最佳实践"},"next":{"title":"单细胞 RNA 测序","url":"/introduction/scrna-seq","group":"介绍"}}},"domain":"http://localhost:3000"}